Pet Store storefront - migrated to Spring Boot
==============================================

This project is a migration of the "petstore" storefront application from the
Java Pet Store Demo 1.3.1_02, originally published by Sun Microsystems, Inc.

The application code in this repository is new. A small number of files are
derived from the original distribution and remain subject to its notice:

  - the catalog and demo-account seed data (derived from Populate-UTF8.xml)
  - the purchase-order document type definitions (PurchaseOrder, ContactInfo,
    Address, CreditCard and LineItem DTDs), kept so that the order hand-off
    contract with the original order-processing system can be verified

